[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pressing the copy prefix anywhere in ACE opens one beautiful, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]discoverable \"Copy as…\" palette: every existing copy target keeps [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]its key as an accelerator, new Markdown-link and metadata-JSON [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]representations join the reference/path/contents targets, marked [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]sets pluralize into paste-ready forms, the artifact-files modal [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]gains the full file-kind representation set, and every copy in the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]TUI rides one delivery seam that pairs OSC 52 with the subprocess [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]adapter, names exactly what was copied, and leaves the generated [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]text selectable when no transport works.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]copy_as_palette.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-az[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-az/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]One clipboard delivery seam with OSC 52 and a selectable [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]fallback[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]delivery[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]delivery: add a unified copy-delivery module that pairs Textual's OSC 52[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]write with the verifiable subprocess adapter (plus a tmux load-buffer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]candidate), reports a typed outcome, standardizes the success/failure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]toast vocabulary, opens a selectable-text fallback modal when no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transport works, and sweeps every TUI copy call site onto the seam and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]off the message pump.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Representation targets and one copy-target registry[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]targets[dim] · [dim][/dim]after delivery[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]targets: collapse the duplicated copy-target label sets into one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry carrying footer labels, palette labels, categories, and plural [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]forms; add uniform Markdown-link and metadata-JSON targets to the four [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Artifacts key groups (link also to changespecs); make marked-set output [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paste-ready per representation (newline-separated references, Markdown [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list, JSON array, skip-and-report partial failures); and size-cap the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contents-shaped targets.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The Copy-as palette modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]palette[dim] · [dim][/dim]after targets[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]palette: make the copy prefix open a compact grouped palette modal built[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from the copy-target registry — configured keys as live accelerators, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warm-data previews, marked-set titles and plural rows, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot-after-dismiss, graceful unknown-key handling — reachable from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every tab, sub-tab, and forwarding modal, with footer/help/docs/PNG [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]File-kind representations in the artifact-files modal[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]files[dim] · [dim][/dim]after palette[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]files: give the artifact-files modal the same palette on the copy prefix[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the full file-kind representation set — @file reference, Markdown [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link, contents, stored path, source path (origin-labeled, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]missing-aware), and metadata JSON matching sase artifact show -j — for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single rows and marked sets, keeping y/Y as accelerators.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-az","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-az.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-6ea37dd9d906e45e60af3b2ed46ab0f8","started_at":"2026-07-29T23:13:34.495378+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"dd0c92f13497445175dd33ac33001b5c1fdbad51c57752f1eefb6fac96fa947e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":2299},"commits":{"digest":"847ec5cf3e19723dcd28be9d54c194eb29dce7ec30a721eb926b3b03770fc2de","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"6ae13ba9eb347e350672a4ce024b9095b315a6b64d301f432af67b5278e7b79d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/meta.json","size_bytes":719},"prompt":{"digest":"3951ab46b5ab4c898dff81105110576aae30d17684c23cbaed535ad9f7b7384f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/prompt.md","size_bytes":159},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"e3199bfc3bb3fb0e8756d544d319f140e5ea8407c94f1830b898ef458a8f1e8f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":7791},"state":{"digest":"3eae72aa11d62c0517380d92f9e459000cbc5abbf631c38471d48b6e3415cb39","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sa